      "object_role": "synthesis",
      "proposed_content": "Taylor polynomialization, Hölder reduction, Vinogradov mean values, and rational approximation produce short-sum cancellation; blockwise Abel summation transfers it to a zeta bound near one; Euler-product positivity and local zero terms convert that growth bound into zero exclusion; a shifted Perron contour then converts the zero-free region into a PNT error term.",
